{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1079540-cruac-and-undocumented-styles","id":1079540,"title":"Cruac and Undocumented Styles..","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-16T15:37:51-07:00","id":1079540,"title":"Cruac and Undocumented Styles..","content":"So there's Unbridled Chaos, The Void, and Primal Creation. But of all the rituals in B&amp;S and Secrets of the Covenants, not one of them actually give rules for the stuff like<br /> &quot;Transmutation&quot; or &quot;Divination&quot; and what not. Where is this outlined and what benefits do these give aside from 4xp per dot to presumably open up a few rituals.<br /> <br /> <br /> edit: I think &quot;Transmutation&quot; refers to the Chaos, Creation for the Primal One, and Divination I guess refers to the Void one. Derp on my part, if anyone knows any other official styles let me know, lol.<br /> <br /> edit: However there's reference to a Destruction based one as well :/","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11492,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11492-arduras","user":"Arduras","date":". 04-16-2017, 06:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11492-arduras","name":"Arduras","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11492_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"206"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-16T15:48:16-07:00","id":1079544,"title":"","content":"In <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/105095/Blood-Sorcery-Sacraments--Blasphemies?\" target=\"_blank\">this book, Blood Sorcery: Sacraments &amp; Blasphemies</a>. If you're familiar with Mage, at least the basics of how it works, it has five 'kinds' of Sorcery, Transmutation, Divination, Destruction, Creation, and Protection, I believe they're called Domains but I don't have the book handy. Each are sort-of an equivalent to an Arcana, from Mage. You can get up to 5 dots in each Domain, the more dots you have, the more you're capable of doing with a ritual within the concepts of that domain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-16T15:55:47-07:00","id":1079547,"title":"","content":"I was under the impression that was for the previous edition, I'll have to check it out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11492-arduras","name":"Arduras","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11492_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"206"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-16T17:44:08-07:00","id":1079583,"title":"","content":"It was written during 1E but is fully compatible with 2E.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-o